"Gilbert Green","Dick Crockett","Sharon Acker","Jack Donner","Billy Curtis","John Gabriel","Dick Durock","Morgan Jones","Beverly Washburn","Guy Raymond","Basil Poledouris","Carey Loftin","Tige Andrews","James Mitchell","Roy N. Sickner","Julie Cobb","Marc Daniels","Don Marshall","Sabrina Scharf","Charles Maxwell","Johnny Haymer","Karl Held","John Warburton","Bill Borzange","Peter Canon","Barry Russo","Anna Karen","Erik Holland","John Wheeler","Joanne Linville","Chuck Courtney","Lawrence Montaigne","Stephen McEveety","William O'Connell","Cal Bolder","David Hurst","Arthur Batanides","Paul Carr","Charles Macaulay","Ena Hartman","Barbara Baldavin","Arlene Martel","Craig Huxley","Kermit Murdock","Noble 'Kid' Chissell","Monty O'Grady","Willard Sage","Bruce Watson","Janet MacLachlan","Mark Lenard","Stewart Moss","Harry Basch","Byron Morrow","Brioni Farrell","William Wintersole","Robert Brown","Steven Marlo","Julie Parrish","Don Eitner","Victor Brandt","Barry Atwater","Joseph Bernard","Richard Carlyle","Charlene Polite","Lee Delano","Irene Kelly","Paul Stader","Serena Sande","Bob Johnson","Miko Mayama","Ed Bakey","Clegg Hoyt","Michael Zaslow","Mary Linda Rapelye","Paul Prokop","Carolyne Barry","Barbara Anderson","Jan Shutan","David Sharpe","Garth Pillsbury","Hagan Beggs","Tanya Lemani","Virginia Aldridge","Charlie Brill","Robert H. Justman","Iona Morris","Nathan Jung","Geoffrey Binney","Patrick Horgan","Robert Hitchcock","William Knight","Alan Marston","Marc Grady Adams","Lincoln Demyan","Alexander Courage","Arch Whiting","Bonnie Beecher","Bart La Rue","Lisabeth Shatner","Kellie Flanagan","Teri Garr","Garrison True","Bruce Mars","Vincent St. Cyr","Stephen Brooks","John Burnside","Bob Whitney","Sheldon Collins","Arnold Lessing","Vic Christy"],"screenwriters":["Gene L. Coon","Gene Roddenberry","D.C. Fontana","Jerome Bixby","John Meredyth Lucas","Jerry Sohl","Robert Bloch","Richard Matheson","George Clayton Johnson","Stanley Adams","Gilbert Ralston","George F. Slavin","John D.F. Black","Stephen Kandel","Adrian Spies","Robert Sabaroff","John T. Dugan","Don Ingalls","Max Ehrlich","Harlan Ellison","Meyer Dolinsky","David P. Harmon","Robert Hamner","Theodore Sturgeon","David Gerrold","Margaret Armen","Barry Trivers","Judy Burns","Lee Erwin","Boris Sobelman","Edward J. Lakso","Steven W. Carabatsos","Arthur Heinemann","Paul Schneider","Shimon Wincelberg","Hendrik Vollaerts","Carey Wilber","Norman Spinrad","Samuel A. Peeples","Don Mankiewicz"],"cinematographers":["Ernest Haller","Gerald Perry Finnerman","William E. Snyder","Al Francis"],"composers":["George Duning","Gerald Fried","Alexander Courage","Sol Kaplan","Fred Steiner","Joseph Mullendore","Samuel Matlovsky","Jerry Fielding"],"reviews":[{"author":"adamulefa","text":"Star Trek z roku 1966 je dedko všetkých sci-fi seriálov. A tento deduško je podľa mňa na takej vysokej úrovni, že každý jeho Star Trekovský potomok nemal ani šancu sa priblížiť k jeho štandardu. Skvelý inteligentný dej, plno dobre zohraných postáv, dychvyrážajúce súboje, nadštandarné špeciálne efekty... OK, možno trochu preháňam. Každopádne ja Star Trek milujem a spolu s ním aj všetky jeho súčasti, ktoré bežnému divákovi prídu ako nedostatky a preto dávajú také nízke hodnotenia.\"SPACE ...\"(11.09.2010)","stars":5},{"author":"fefee","text":"Klasika! Lepšie slovo tento sci-fi seriál nezachycuje. Typická Kirkova pravačka a jeho ženské \"francuzáky\", paprndeklové efekty vyrobené v garáži, a Spok ktorého charizma a inteligencia je stredobodom celého vesmíru (a to oprávnene) sú charakteristickým znakom každého dielu. Odhliadnuc od toho že niektoré diely, treba sebakriticky priznať, boli takzvane uspávacie, tak každý z nich (nech to znie akokoľvek pateticky a klišovito) nesie jednoduchý a jasný odkaz či myšlienku, pri ktorom si nejedna úprimná duša musí priznať svoje chyby. Ale na to sa robia aby sa z nich človek poučil...(26.03.2016)","stars":3},{"author":"Radiq","text":"Ok, uznávám, že za přínos žánru by se tomu mělo děkovat a nosit dary, ale z objektivního hlediska je to hroznej šit. Kdo v tom nevyrůstal, tak ani nemůže mít k tomu takovej vztah, jak třeba zažranci v US, kteří mají Spocka za boha (neřikám, že to nebyla nejlepší postava). Je na tom prostě zahlodanej zub času pohřbenej v masovým hrobě na spodu pod těly židů. Efekty nic. Příběhy se furt motaly kolem 20. století nebo kolem historie Země. Nepřátelé vtipní. Členové posádky hrdinní, ale na druhou stranu tak chybující, že to logika nebere. Čumim, že s nima Spock vydržel, když dělali takový nelogický nesmysly. Takže po třech sériích jsem rád, že jsem to všechno přetrpěl, abych mohl bez nadsázky zhodnotit a říct tomu pro příště jedno velký NE.(21.05.2010)","stars":1}],"vods":[],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/70788-star-trek/prehled/","csfd_id":70788,"root_id":70788,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":3,"episode_count":79,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":null,"first_vod_date":null,"last_vod_date":null,"episodes":[]}